+    arguments, and on iuse only where a flag to enable ends with "_*". So
+    when no such flag was seen and no warning was printed (a memo hit would
+    not print it again), memoizable is
+    True and regenerate() may answer a later call with equal use_stack_inputs
+    from _regenerate_use_stack_memo. setcpv() calls regenerate() for every
+    package, and most packages have the same USE inputs as an earlier one.
